## AddonCompartmentFuncOnLeave: CleanRangedSounds_CompartmentLeave

# Load order is the dependency order: Sounds owns the sound list, the saved settings, the muting and
# playback, Release plays a kept shot sound on your own shots, and Options builds the settings
# panel, the slash command and the addon-menu entry on top of both.

Core\Sounds.lua
Core\Release.lua
UI\Options.lua
